    $ pi compose log_(tilde(G))(h) = log_(tilde(K)) compose phi(h) = log_(tilde(K))(1_tilde(K)) = 0 $
    Hence, showing that the tangent space $Lie(H) subset.eq ker(pi) = [frak(g),frak(g)]$. So, the full correspondance is as follow:
    #set align(center)
    #diagram($
